     "block": "r14",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "r10.1",
     "text": "If unit5 is sound (signal audible), then unit5 is logged.",
     "role": "given",
     "block": "r10",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n18.1",
     "text": "Because unit5 is bundled and unit5 is retained and unit5 is packed, unit3 is ready.",
     "role": "claimed",
     "block": "n18",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n18.2",
     "text": "The checks that unit5 is stacked and unit5 is coded and unit5 is scanned would imply that unit1 is stable and unit5 is stable and unit5 is stable, respectively.",
     "role": "claimed",
     "block": "n18",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n07.1",
     "text": "Since unit5 is mounted and unit5 is routed and unit5 is rated, it follows that unit3 is ready.",
     "role": "claimed",
     "block": "n07",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n03.1",
     "text": "Given that unit3 is ready and unit3 is ready, we infer that unit5 is ready.",
     "role": "claimed",
     "block": "n03",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n08.1",
     "text": "It follows that unit5 is weighed-in because unit3 is ready and the immediately preceding ready result holds.",
     "role": "claimed",
     "block": "n08",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n16.1",
     "text": "Because unit5 is weighed-in, unit3 is sound.",
     "role": "claimed",
     "block": "n16",
     "asserting": true
    },
    {
     "id": "n12.1",
     "text": "Since unit3 is sound, it follows that unit3 is sound.",
